        "name": "恶意中伤",
        "sourcePath": "Perks/Styles/Domination/CheapShot",
        "tooltip": "对<b>移动或行动受损</b>的敌人造成<trueDamage>@DamageCalc@额外真实伤害</trueDamage>。<br>冷却时间：@Cooldown@秒<br><rules>会在移动受损之后触发伤害。</rules><br><br>已造成的额外伤害总和：@f1@",
        "shortDescription": "对<lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword key='LinkTooltip_Description_ImpairAct'>移动或行动受损的</lol-uikit-tooltipped-keyword>敌方英雄造成额外真实伤害。",
